\tag{fnip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The currents meet in one balance}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{The ionic currents meet in the [membrane equation](fnip-0066).
A conductance may be replaced by a function of the voltage and of
further variables. That replacement leaves the balance as it stands:
the capacitive current is still the applied current minus the sum of
the ionic currents.}
